<title>POLAND: PLI 96 group net falls to PLN 4.3 mln.</title>
<headline>PLI 96 group net falls to PLN 4.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>PLI group results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						    1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		  1.60   vs    0.74 loss</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		   11.12   vs    8.86</p>
<p>    Group net profit			  4.25   vs    8.30</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Polish Life Improvement SA.</p>
<p>    Group net sales			     40.72   vs   70.62</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales			31.80   vs   58.89</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    Group income tax			     5.35   vs    0.69</p>
<p>    Group other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.16</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues		  26.85   vs    1.76</p>
<p>    Group financial costs		     16.64   vs    1.15</p>
<p>    Group investment			    48.66   vs   13.72</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
